<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bank sets warrants on Hutchison.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank sets warrants on Hutchison.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London</p>
<p>Branch, said on Tuesday it priced 80 million American-style</p>
<p>warrants on shares of Hutchison Whampoa Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$63.25	 PREMIUM	   16 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.012	 GEARING	   6.3X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  21.JAN.98	MIN EXER LOT    10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	LISTING DATE    26.FEB.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$63.25	 PAY DATE	  24.FEB.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  PHYSICAL DELIVERY ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
